@Management_Host = http://localhost:5177
@accessToken = {{superadminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Health
GET {{Management_Host}}/health

###

### Login as SuperAdmin (use Auth service — same JWT)
# @name superadminLogin
POST http://localhost:5237/api/v1.0/auth/account/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "superadmin@billflow.local",
  "password": "YOUR_SUPERADMIN_PASSWORD"
}

###

### Admin — GetAll (SuperAdmin only)
GET {{Management_Host}}/api/v1.0/management/Admin/GetAll
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Admin — Create
POST {{Management_Host}}/api/v1.0/management/Admin/Create
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "New Admin",
  "email": "admin@billflow.local",
  "password": "AdminPass123!",
  "phoneNumber": null
}

###

### Visitor — GetAll (Admin or SuperAdmin)
GET {{Management_Host}}/api/v1.0/management/Visitor/GetAll
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
